# A Clone that leaves the battlefield and returns is a new object (CR 400.7), and the copy effect applies again as it
# enters, with a new choice (CR 614.1c, 707.2). On turn 3 Bot1's Clone copies Bot1's Ornithopter (Bot2's Sylvan
# Caryatid is the other candidate); then Ephemerate exiles the Clone and returns it, and this time it copies the
# Caryatid. In the end Bot1 has its Ornithopter and a Caryatid, and no second Ornithopter; Ephemerate is exiled by
# rebound.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Ornithopter
Clone
Ephemerate
Plains
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Emerald
Sylvan Caryatid
Forest x17

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Sylvan Caryatid.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Clone.Cast
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Plains; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter#2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Plains; Mox Sapphire; Ornithopter; Sylvan Caryatid
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Types = Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Sylvan Caryatid.Keywords = Defender; Hexproof
Exile = Ephemerate
Bot2.Battlefield = Forest; Mox Emerald; Sylvan Caryatid
